# Two pipes with nothing between them: DS0103, with a fix that removes one.
mode: syntax
---- query
'orders.csv' | | take 5
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..24
  PIPELINE@0..23
    LITERAL@0..12
      STRING@0..12 "'orders.csv'"
    WHITESPACE@12..13 " "
    PIPE@13..14 "|"
    WHITESPACE@14..15 " "
    PIPE@15..16 "|"
    WHITESPACE@16..17 " "
    TAKE_OP@17..23
      IDENT@17..21 "take"
      WHITESPACE@21..22 " "
      LITERAL@22..23
        LONG@22..23 "5"
  WHITESPACE@23..24 "\n"

error[DS0103]: two `|` in a row
  --> query:1:14
  |
1 | 'orders.csv' | | take 5
  |              ^ no operator after this `|`
  |
  = help: remove the extra `|`

with the machine-applicable fixes applied:
    'orders.csv' | take 5
which parses without errors
